{"id":"f4a68d01f29a7aed","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-graph-incidence-matrix.md","title":"ZFC Graph Incidence Matrix","display":"df-zfc-graph-incidence-matrix — ZFC Graph Incidence Matrix","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-graph-incidence-matrix","aliases":["58-df-zfc-graph-incidence-matrix"],"display":"df-zfc-graph-incidence-matrix — ZFC Graph Incidence Matrix","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-graph-incidence-matrix"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-graph-incidence-matrix</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-graph-incidence-matrix — ZFC Graph Incidence Matrix"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-graph.md\">../batch03/58-df-graph.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,G,V_0,E\\in V\">\\(B,G,V_0,E\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Graph}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Graph}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-graph.md\">../batch03/58-df-graph.md</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphIncidenceMatrix}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGraphIncidenceMatrix}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}incidence\\text{-}matrix} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGraphIncidenceMatrix}_S(B,G,V_0,E)\\leftrightarrow\nG=\\langle V_0,E\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(B,V_0\\times E,\\{0,1\\})\\land\n\\forall v\\in V_0\\;\\forall e\\in E\\;\n(B(\\langle v,e\\rangle)=1\\leftrightarrow v\\in e)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}incidence\\text{-}matrix} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGraphIncidenceMatrix}_S(B,G,V_0,E)\\leftrightarrow\nG=\\langle V_0,E\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(B,V_0\\times E,\\{0,1\\})\\land\n\\forall v\\in V_0\\;\\forall e\\in E\\;\n(B(\\langle v,e\\rangle)=1\\leftrightarrow v\\in e)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"r